# Self-contained xterm-256color entry for the bundled upstream mosh-client.
# Reconstructed with `infocmp -I -x xterm-256color` from ncurses 6.6.
# Keeping the source (instead of a compiled binary) makes the APK asset
# reproducible and avoids depending on Android having a system terminfo DB.
